Package: nimay-omp-bridge
Version: 1.0.1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: nodejs (>= 18), bash, coreutils
Maintainer: Nimay OMP <nimay@nimay.net>
Description: Nimay OMP Bridge â€” Linux
 Bridges the Nimay OMP Android app to a local OMP instance on port 7802.
 Installs at /opt/nimay-omp-bridge and registers a systemd service that
 starts automatically on boot (no login required). Pair the Android app
 via the pairing token shown after installation.
Homepage: https://chat.nimay.net/nimayomp/

